# Bridge applied-state query for manager startup reconciliation.
# The bridge reports exactly what it last applied (epoch + canonical
# snapshot hash + complete active set). The hash covers ALL
# authorization-relevant semantics (geometry, not just IDs): the manager
# compares (epoch, hash) against its durable decision and NEVER adopts
# bridge state as authoritative (correctness revision).
---
uint64 active_epoch
rulesync_interfaces/RuleSpec[] active_rules
string active_hash
